    <string name="excel_upload_instructions_title">How Excel upload works</string>
    <string name="excel_upload_instructions">Upload a sales backup file exported from Vikr Saathi (.xlsx format).\n\nRequired columns (first row must be headers):\n• Bill Number\n• Date (yyyy-MM-dd)\n• Item Name\n• Quantity\n• MRP\n\nOptional columns:\n• Invoice Counter, Customer Name, Customer Phone, Customer Address, Discount %, Line Total, Bill Total\n\nEach row is one line item. Rows with the same Bill Number are grouped into one bill. Existing bill numbers are skipped. New customers and items are created automatically when needed.\n\nLegacy .xls and .csv files are also supported for import.</string>
